{"product":{"id":4484107206791,"title":"POLYGON - Office Pack","body_html":"\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cb\u003eSynty® Studios\u003c\/b\u003e presents: \u003cspan\u003e POLYGON - Office Pack\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA low poly asset pack of Props, Characters, and Modular Building assets to create an Office themed polygonal style game.\u003cbr\u003eIncludes a detailed demo scene\u003cbr\u003e(Character poses indicative only)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e◼ \u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003c\/strong\u003e ◼\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA complete office themed demo scene ready to use in your project\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e18 Characters both male and female with alternate colors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModular building pieces so you can build and configure thousands of office layouts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e600+ props to completely dress your office space and make it feel lively\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Contents may vary between engines.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e📦 Pack Content\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA complete office layout demo scene\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProps (x626)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Coffee cups, Printers, PC gear, Desks, Kitchen Props, Bathrooms, Party supplies.\u003cbr\u003eSee Layout images for HEAPS more!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModular Building Pieces (x128)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Modular building set, Modular stairwell, Modular ceiling and roof.\u003cbr\u003eSee Layout images for HEAPS more!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharacters (x18)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Office workers Male x04, Office Workers Female x04, Cleaners x02, Developers x04, Security x02, Boss Male and Female\u003cbr\u003e(with Alternative Colors)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThere is heaps of awesome content in this pack! See the layout screenshots for more details.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e🤖 Technical Info\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e◼ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e◼\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e- Compatible with Unity 2022.3+\u003cbr\u003e- Compatible with Unreal 5.3+\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Characters set up with Mecanim (No animations included)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e- Unity Render Pipeline Support:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStandard\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eURP\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/bit.ly\/synty-urp\" title=\"Converting to the Universal Render Pipeline\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eView our tutorial\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e on converting to the Universal Render Pipeline (URP).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e◼ \u003c\/span\u003eFile Formats \u003cspan\u003e◼\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e- Unity 2022.3 \u003cspan data-offset-key=\"c4qro-0-0\"\u003ePackage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Unreal 5.3 Project\u003cbr\u003e